# To configure a custom domain (e.g., mahionlabs.com):
# 1. Rename this file to CNAME (without .example) or set the Custom Domain in GitHub Pages repo settings.
# 2. Put your domain name on the first line (e.g., mahionlabs.com).
# 3. Update `siteUrl` in `src/config/site.ts` and `astro.config.mjs` to https://mahionlabs.com
mahionlabs.com
